==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|explicare|explicāre|lang=la}}, present active infinitive of {{term|explico|explicō|unfold", "to explain|lang=la}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|explicat|ing}}

# {{transitive}} To [[explain]] [[meticulous|meticulously]] or in great [[detail]]; to [[elucidate]]; to [[analyze]].
#: ''My homework is to '''explicate''' a poem.''
# to develop a principle, theory, etc.

====Related terms====
* [[explication]]
* [[explicative]]
* [[explicator]]
* [[explicit]]

